1
00:00:00,204 --> 00:00:02,624
(Bernadette:)- Howard.
- No, that's okay, Bernadette.

2
00:00:02,790 --> 00:00:04,830
(Penny:)Sometimes these things
just don't work out.

3
00:00:05,043 --> 00:00:09,133
Yeah. It's all good. We'll always
have feelings for each other.

4
00:00:11,716 --> 00:00:13,846
(Bernadette:)Oh. That's nice.

5
00:00:15,178 --> 00:00:16,968
See? She knew what "always" meant.

6
00:00:17,388 --> 00:00:19,728
(Penny:)Wow, you're like a dog with a bone,
aren't you?

7
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:23,310
- I'm just making a point.
- ls the point you don't know...

8
00:00:23,478 --> 00:00:26,188
(Penny:)- ...when to let something go?
- People, people, please.

9
00:00:26,355 --> 00:00:28,395
(Sheldon:)Before you say something
you both regret...

10
00:00:28,566 --> 00:00:30,026
(Sheldon:)...I'd like to place my order.

11
00:00:31,652 --> 00:00:34,532
Yeah, hang on, Sheldon.
You know why we can't be together?

12
00:00:34,739 --> 00:00:37,489
(Penny:)- Because you always have to be right.
- That is not true.

13
00:00:37,700 --> 00:00:42,120
I gotta go with Leonard on this.
He is wrong more than anyone I know.

14
00:00:42,663 --> 00:00:46,333
You know what, I just realized
I'm on a break. I'll get someone else.

15
00:00:47,502 --> 00:00:49,632
(Sheldon:)Promise me
when our new waitress comes over...

16
00:00:49,796 --> 00:00:53,636
(Sheldon:)...you will not start a complicated,
on-again, off-again relationship with her.

17
00:00:53,800 --> 00:01:07,030
Because I'm very very hungry.

